This is CRX Manager V1.0, an agricultural product distribution management system for Crop RX Solutions.

Stack: React 18, TypeScript, Vite, Tailwind CSS, Supabase (PostgreSQL, Auth, Storage, Realtime).
Deployed to Vercel. Tests with Playwright.

Design rules:
- Make pages beautiful and production-worthy, not cookie cutter
- Use Tailwind CSS for styling. Brand green: #28A26A (available as `crx-green` in tailwind config)
- Use Lucide React for all icons. Do not install other UI or icon packages
- All pages must be lazy-loaded (follow pattern in src/App.tsx)

Database rules:
- Supabase client is in src/lib/db.ts -- use this singleton, never create another client
- RLS is enabled on ALL tables. Never disable it. All new tables MUST have RLS policies
- After .update() or .delete() calls, use checkMutationResult() from src/lib/db.ts
- Schema changes must go through migration files in supabase/migrations/

Code conventions:
- TypeScript types go in src/types/index.ts
- Activity logging via logActivity() in src/lib/activityLogger.ts
- Idempotency keys via generateIdempotencyKey() in src/lib/idempotency.ts
- Image compression via compressImage() in src/lib/imageCompression.ts

For full context: read CONTEXT.md (business context), DATABASE_RELATIONSHIPS.md (entity relationships), SCHEMA_QUICK_REFERENCE.sql (all 25 tables).

Current state: Tier 1-3 hardening complete. Deployed to Vercel staging. Next task: comprehensive test coverage.
